  <p>The single most useful thing I can give you is real sodium numbers per serving, because that is exactly what nobody else consolidates. Here is the honest comparison of the brands that come up most often in the low-sodium jerky conversation, sorted lowest to highest sodium. I am not fabricating anything — every number below is pulled from a currently-published nutrition panel:</p>
